    <briefdescription>
<para>An immutable pass that tracks lazily created <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_assumption_cache" kindref="compound">AssumptionCache</ref></computeroutput> objects. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is essentially a workaround for the legacy pass manager&apos;s weaknesses which associates each assumption cache with <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> and clears it if the function is deleted. The nature of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_assumption_cache" kindref="compound">AssumptionCache</ref> is that it is not invalidated by any changes to the function body and so this is sufficient to be conservatively correct. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
